  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="02039bed-7b95-5a86-9980-224ff696bfa7" activityNameId="71159ff5-0fce-54fd-959c-3fe72748fd10" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Grass from meadow intensive IP, at field</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Grass from meadow intensive IP, at field
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of fresh gras from intensive IP production with 1.66 kg CO2  and 17.9 MJ per kg dry matter. The dry matter content of fresh gras is about 10-15% ;
UUID: 7521559b-1ba5-3113-88de-95a1effa5532
The inventories include the cultivation of gras on a temporary meadow. Included steps are soil cultivation, pestizides against Rumex, fertilisation (slurry and mineral fertilizer), harvest, loading for transport.
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Intensive IP production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7521559b-1ba5-3113-88de-95a1effa5532.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
